exp_04 (yaw augmentation, started 2026-09-12, SOP-native, record `worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_04_yaw_aug_xrir_claude/`, plan v4 + amendments A1–A10 in §11): train the SimpleViT with per-sample active yaw of the whole scene (offsets d ~ U{0..511} from a counter-seeded generator, `tools/yaw_aug.py`, port of FLAC exp_17; audio untouched; alignment on the rotated geometry) and test non-inferiority at k = 0 (H1, +3 %), reduced degradation vs the control at ±22.5°/±45° (H2, C50 primary) and near-invariance (TOST ±2 %), each with five evaluation seeds 42–46 (manifests `ckpt/yaw_aug/reference_manifest_k{8,1}_seed*.json`). **Closure rule:** exp_03's committed record pins 12 files (`eval_yaw_rotation.py`, `eval_unseen.py`, `eval_xRIR_backbone.py`, `model/*.py`, `tools/{yaw_rotation,reference_manifest,per_sample_metrics}.py`, the dataset module, `utils/spec_utils.py`); any later commit touching them fails `tests/test_exp03_record_tools.py`, so new behaviour lives in new modules that import them. Tool chain (all reviewed by Fable subagents, Codex-coded, 785 tests): `train_xRIR_backbone.py --yaw-aug 1 --yaw-aug-seed 0 --yaw-aug-width 512 [--no-save]`; `tools/provenance.py` (hermetic import-derived closures, data inventories, exclusive manifests / atomic completions, revalidate); `tools/exp04_eval.py` (= the frozen evaluator's functions + immutable eval-manifest handshake, `--conditions P`); `tools/exp04_eval_launch.py` (run dir, manifest, tee, finalisation, `--bind-input`, `--gpu`); `tools/exp04_launcher.py` + `tools/exp04_launch.sh` (modes smoke/probe/full/finalize/refuse-test; golden argv in the record's `yaw_aug_xrir_results_assets/`; resource/banner/args guards; `abort.json`, ABORTED renames, 43 h ceiling on `full` attempts, promotion symlink `ckpt/xRIR_simple_yawaug_8_shot/final`); `tools/exp04_profiles.py` (+ runtime-read `yaw_aug_xrir_results_assets/approved_digests.json`, all-null until the second reviewed commit); `tools/paired_compare.py` (profiles H1_K8/H1_K1/H2_K8/TOST